ide supersedes them, so confirm active consumers before finding. Distill prompt says bogus facts pollute permanently although lifecycle removal exists. semantic_agent_guide step 9 is an overloaded ~20-line command description mixing contract categories. Handoff provider prompt claims three gaps but enumerates four; historical instructions are not audit instructions.\\n')\nprint('covered',sum(x['review_status']=='source-inspected' for x in a))\nPY"],"cwd":"file:///Users/thomi/.codex/worktrees/5d33/entire-brain","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\nb=Path('/Users/thomi/.codex/visualizations/2026/09/18/01a0b6ce-e2ad-7853-bb2f-19731062a2c9/code-quality-audit');p=b/'coverage.json';a=json.loads(p.read_text());names={'CHANGELOG.md','docs/operations.md','docs/manifest-loading-validation.md','docs/graph-identity-upgrades.md','docs/shared-fact-identity.md','docs/recall-evidence.md','templates/entire-brain-distill.md','templates/entire-brain-intake-claude-agent.md','templates/entire-brain-intake-codex-skill.md','templates/entire-brain-recall-claude-agent.md','templates/entire-brain-recall-codex-skill.md','docs/semantic_agent_guide.md','docs/entire_cli_semantic_provider_prompt.md'}\nfor x in a:\n if x['path'] in names:x.update(review_status='source-inspected',checks=['Complete document/template read; compared documented contracts with reviewed source.'],notes='Historical claims treated as dated reports, not current guarantees. Verbose changelog and stale guidance candidates recorded.')\np.write_text(json.dumps(a,indent=2)+'\\n')\nwith (b/'expanded-findings.md').open('a') as f:f.write('\\n### Documentation coverage notes, first batch\\nREADME typo “Brain is set up is per”; operations installer “four effects and no others” overclaims build/network/cache effects. Changelog repeats Added/Changed/Fixed sections under same release and uses multi-paragraph rhetoric and all-caps emphasis; F7 broader editorial supplement. Histor