he evidence array explains the edge from one side only. The affected edges are counted, not identified: each record had already been written when its second producer appeared, so none of them can be marked individually and a consume\\n\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0cb48b2b18d09e75016aaec93ffbd887d2b0b72c70c4818a2a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0ba4f-3944-7ce3-88ac-4c7975e84b1b"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_GYdhE8SqkCMwadYBxDoIpxLr","id":"ctc_0cb48b2b18d09e75016aaec941075087d2b19c28cc2e2349e3","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - \u003c\u003c'PY'\\nimport json,pathlib,shutil,collections\\nb=pathlib.Path('/Users/thomi/.codex/visualizations/2026/09/18/01a0b6ce-e2ad-7853-bb2f-19731062a2c9/code-quality-audit');p=b/'coverage.json';a=json.loads(p.read_text())\\nfor x in a:\\n if x['path'].endswith(('/power_analysis.py','/test_power_analysis.py','/power_analysis_v4.py','/test_power_analysis_v4.py','/test_power_analysis_v4_hardening.py')):\\n  x.update(review_status='source-inspected',checks=['Complete implementation and test source read; synthetic bounded FIFO reproduction for v4 loader.'],notes='F100 v4 regular-file loader blocks before fstat. Pending-only v3 and unauthenticated v4 decision states intentional.')\\np.write_text(json.dumps(a,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nfor name in ['audit-power-fifo.py','audit-power-reader-impact.json','audit-power-reader-brain.json']:shutil.copyfile('/tmp/'+name,b/'evidence'/name)\\n(b/'evidence/audit-power-fifo-result.json').write_text(json.dumps({'blocked':True,'module_loaded':True,'terminated':True})+'\\\\n')\\nwith (b/'expanded-findings.md').open('a') as f:f.write('''\\\\n## F100 — P2: Power-v4 regular-file loader hangs before validating a FIFO\\\\nLocation: `benchmarks/agent-brain/confirmatory/power_analysis_v4.py:143–151`. `_read_regular_bytes` opens with O_RDONLY and no O_NONBLOCK; opening a named pipe with no writer blocks before fstat can enforce regular-file status or the size bound. This affects CLI calibration/report and all bundle inputs. A synthetic local FIFO remained blocked after three seconds; the child was terminated and cleaned up. Add nonblocking open before descriptor-type validation and a real FIFO regression test. No repository files changed. Graph impact resolves `_load_json_artifact` and `_file_sha256`, then load_calibration/load_power_report/load_artifact_bundle and implementation-lock consumers. Brain doc:64fd80deaa54 records raw-file validation intent, with no reason for blocking special files. Evidence: evidence/audit-power-fifo.py, audit-power-fifo-result.json, audit-power-reader-impact.json, audit-power-reader-brain.json.\\\\n\\\\n### Power coverage notes\\\\nV3 deliberately rejects numeric evaluated state and retains historical sensitivity helpers; do not report pending state itself as defect. V4 repeats resample generation in analyze and report validation, and again under check; pending reports generate all grid draws despite null powers. Statistical code uses observed cost-scale CI offsets with alternative-rescaled draws (candidate methodology issue requiring independent statistical validation). Strict loader misses overflow nonfinite JSON constants such as 1e999 until later validation. Report validation is structural; check_power_report performs exact recomputation and tests explicitly enforce this distinction.\\\\n''')\\nprint(collections.Counter((x['category'],x['review_status']) for x in a))\\nprint([(x['path'],x['lines']) for x in a if x['review_status']=='pending' and x['category'] not in ['data/fixtures']][:160])\\nPY\",\"max_output_tokens\":7000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789839678.0173,"turn_id":"01a0ba4f-3944-7ce3-88ac-4c7975e84b1b"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_GYdhE8SqkCMwadYBxDoIpxLr","id":"ctco_01a0bac2-7aec-7832-9ee3-5d362a9cc08