.json\naudit-brief-new-repro.log\naudit-checklist-gate-brain.json\naudit-compact-review-brain.json\naudit-compact-review-impact.json\naudit-compact-review-overlay.json\naudit-compact-review-repro.log\naudit-compact-review_test.go\naudit-excerpt-brain.json\naudit-generation-id-brain.json\naudit-generation-id-impact.json\naudit-generation-id-overlay.json\naudit-generation-id-test.log\naudit-generation-id_test.go\naudit-historyRawLineExcerpt-impact.json\naudit-profile-dispatch-brain.json\naudit-profile-dispatch-impact.json\naudit-profile-dispatch-test.log\naudit-semantic-current-brain.json\naudit-semantic-current-impact.json\naudit-semantic-current-overlay.json\naudit-semantic-current-test.log\naudit-semantic-current_test.go\naudit-semantic-discovery.json\naudit-testlayout-brain.json\naudit.md\ncontinuation.md\ncoverage.json\nevidence\nexpanded-findings.md\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":2334},"formatted_output":"/Users/thomi/.codex/worktrees/5d33/entire-brain\naudit-brainBriefActionChecklist-impact.json\naudit-brainBriefLikelyTestFile-impact.json\naudit-brief-brain.json\naudit-brief-discovery.json\naudit-brief-new-repro.log\naudit-checklist-gate-brain.json\naudit-compact-review-brain.json\naudit-compact-review-impact.json\naudit-compact-review-overlay.json\naudit-compact-review-repro.log\naudit-compact-review_test.go\naudit-excerpt-brain.json\naudit-generation-id-brain.json\naudit-generation-id-impact.json\naudit-generation-id-overlay.json\naudit-generation-id-test.log\naudit-generation-id_test.go\naudit-historyRawLineExcerpt-impact.json\naudit-profile-dispatch-brain.json\naudit-profile-dispatch-impact.json\naudit-profile-dispatch-test.log\naudit-semantic-current-brain.json\naudit-semantic-current-impact.json\naudit-semantic-current-overlay.json\naudit-semantic-current-test.log\naudit-semantic-current_test.go\naudit-semantic-discovery.json\naudit-testlayout-brain.json\naudit.md\ncontinuation.md\ncoverage.json\nevidence\nexpanded-findings.md\n"},"started_