red tests passed: **9/9**\\n\\nWrote /private/tmp/audit-retained-distill/distill-perf-audit-report.json and distill-perf-audit-report.md\\n\"}}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"result\":{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"e4ca6e\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000001417,\"exit_code\":1,\"original_token_count\":178,\"output\":\"\\nDistill performance artifacts are not release evidence:\\n- source_sha256.internal/cli/distill_cmd.go mismatch\\n# Distill Performance Evidence Audit\\n\\n- Status: **FAIL**\\n- Release evidence: **false**\\n- Target: **github.com/entireio/cli**\\n- Claim scope: **large-repo (entireio/cli) local command-agent distill extraction scheduling speedup**\\n- Required speedup: **1.5x**\\n- Observed speedup: **1.7940311633699453x**\\n- Dry-run chunks: **2443**\\n- Source hashes checked: **5/6**\\n- Local Ollama contract artifact: **go-test-internal-cli-ollama-distill.jsonl**\\n- Local Ollama required tests passed: **9/9**\\n\\nWrote /private/tmp/audit-retained-distill-large/distill-perf-audit-report.json and distill-perf-audit-report.md\\n\"}}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0ba4f-3944-7ce3-88ac-4c7975e84b1b","create_time":1789840157.957629}}}
