{"timestamp":"2026-09-19T17:49:37.251Z","ordinal":7872,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0b6ce-e2ad-7853-bb2f-19731062a2c9","turn_id":"01a0ba4f-3944-7ce3-88ac-4c7975e84b1b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cb48b2b18d09e75016aaecb2f15d487d28f0428d1407e4b38","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ve also rechecked retained benchmark evidence without running agents. The clean history benchmark passes its evidence audit. Both retained distillation performance reports fail their current-source hash check, so they cannot support a claim about today’s code. These results will be included in the report.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789840175210,"completed_at_ms":1789840177251}}
