tgithub.com/ashtom/entire-brain/internal/config\t(cached)\nok  \tgithub.com/ashtom/entire-brain/internal/tui\t(cached)\nWS6 preparation checks passed\n.......................\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- proof_ready_comparisons 0 < required 1\n- hard_flags 5 > 0\n- suite release-candidate-leaky-queries has no proof_ready comparison\n- proof_ready_comparisons[history] 0 < required 1\n.\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- hard_flags 1 > 0\n..............\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- proof_ready_comparisons 0 < required 1\n\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- proof_ready_comparisons 0 < required 1\n- hard_flags 3 > 0\n\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- proof_ready_comparisons 0 < required 1\n- hard_flags 9 > 0\n\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- hard_flags 1 > 0\n\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- suites 0 < required 1\n- records 0 < required 1\n..\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- mcp_named_tool_verified_records 0 < required 1\n.\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- proof_ready_comparisons 0 < required 1\n- hard_flags 2 > 0\n- suite release-candidate-semantic-proof has no proof_ready comparison\n- proof_ready_comparisons[history] 0 < required 1\n.\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- proof_ready_comparisons 0 < required 1\n- hard_flags 5 > 0\n- suite release-candidate-host-path-leak has no proof_ready comparison\n- proof_ready_comparisons[history] 0 < required 1\n.\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- proof_ready_comparisons[semantic] 0 < required 1\n.\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- mcp_verified_records 0 < required 1\n.\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- named_tool_proof_ready_comparisons[mcp] 0 < required 1\n.\nAudit is not release evidence:\n- suite release-candidate-semantic-no-signal has no proof_ready comparison\n.................# Codex Benchmark Audit (independent re-check)\n\n- Suites audited: **1**\n- Agent records audited (prep excluded): **8**\n- **Hard integrity flags: 0**\n- Integrity-verified MCP datapoints (real calls + parentless baseline 