nmark/candidates/fresh/SNAPSHOT.json\n{'base_ref': 'master', 'base_sha': '8855072aab605c68a4705f7d69875673bfbf81d4', 'body': 'Bumps [com.microsoft.azure:azure-storage](https://github.com/Azure/azure-storage-java) from 8.6.0 to 8.6.6.\\n<details>\\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/azure-storage-java/releases\">com.microsoft.azure:azure-storage\\'s releases</a>.</em></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<h2>Java Storage Client Library 8.6.6</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Upgraded keyvault dependency to pull in security fix in google.guava 24.1.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Java Storage Client Library 8.6.5</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed a race condition in XML parsing logic that in narrow situations could cause the parser to be initialized incorrectly resulting in an erroneously empty list result.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Java Storage Client Library 8.6.4</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Converted the httpsKeepAliveSocketFactory into a singleton for performance improvements.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Java Storage Client Library 8.6.3</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Added the commitWriteOnInputStreamException option to BlobRequestOptions, which will allow the user to configure whether any data staged through openWrite when using the upload(InputStream, long) method will be committed upon failures in the InputStream.</li>\\n<li>Disabled httpsKeepAlive by default as it can introduce some perf issues.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Java Storage Client Library 8.6.2</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed a bug in the pom that disrupted the ability to download from maven central.</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2>Java Storage Client Library 8.6.1</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Fixed a bug in BlobInputStream that would return extra zeros at the end of the stream if the data was encrypted using client-side encryption.</li>\\n<li>MD5 checks on BlobInputStream are skipped if data being downloaded is also being decrypted via client-side encryption, even if disableMd5Calculation is set to false. Previously this check would always fail as MD5 is calculated on cipher text on upload but was calculated on plaintext on download.</li>\\n<li>Added a workaround to a JDK bug that would ignore connection timeouts on retries, causing hangs in some scenarios. This requires defaulting setting https keep-alive on all sockets. It can be disabled via BlobRequestOptions.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</blockquote>\\n</details>\\n<details>\\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/azure-storage-java/blob/v8.6.6/ChangeLo\nbrainmark/candidates/INDEX.json\n{'candidate_count': 1806, 'candidate_file_sha256': 1806, 'candidate_pair_ids': 1806, 'config_sha256': 'd66480356e3f880d8303b3a98c1758b200c6bd68ea8a483b462b63eddf36ffdb', 'miner_sha256': 'cce6937ff555d7209f4ea87f400b00337075726875fa3bbac6a45a7a7c932345', 'mining_gates': 6, 'per_repo': 53, 'pool_revisions': 3, 'pool_size': 2594, 'pools': 3, 'rejects': 5, 'schema_version': 1, 'sources': 6, 'unverifiable_repos': 0}\nbrainmark/review/SLATE.json\n{'a_instance_id': 'axios__axios-4731', 'b_instance_id': 'axios__axios-4738', 'file_jaccard': 1.0, 'language': 'JavaScript', 'language_source': 'instance', 'needs_human_review': False, 'pair_id': 'axios__axios-4731__then__axios__axios-4738', 'patch_body_overlap': 0.0, 'pool': 'local', 'rank': 1, 'rationale': ['SEL_STRATUM_FLOOR', 'DEV_PROPOSED'], 'repo': 'axios/axios', 'score': 2.0, 'shared_files': ['lib/adapters/http.js'], 'sheet': 'sheets/001_axios__axios-4731__then__axios__axios-4738.md', 'stratum': 'local/JavaScript', 'symbol_overlap': 1.0}\nbrainmark/candidates/preactjs__preact-2757__then__preactjs__preact-3763.json\n{'a': {'base_commit': 'b17a932342bfdeeaf1dc0fbe4f436c83e258d6c8', 'created_at': '2020-09-19 09:38:08', 'files': ['src/diff/index.js'], 'instance_id': 'preactjs__preact-2757', 'language': 'JavaScript', 'patch_sha256': 'aa97cd3df39e8c877daef89607654fc6744232e6ef499914f31cccd5a0a1342a', 'problem_statement_sha256': 'c4a64c16f0197524c52600a28f78e570a172ca47421b25874890028a74e5b394', 'version': '2757'}, 'ancestry_ve