{"timestamp":"2026-09-19T20:01:09.793Z","ordinal":8445,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0b6ce-e2ad-7853-bb2f-19731062a2c9","turn_id":"01a0bb40-0204-7de1-a470-e55eab47a99a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0cb48b2b18d09e75016aaeea03cc2487d29a723b0f8f69eceb","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The first three agents are working on export preservation, purge retries, and review exclusions. I’ll start the other four as slots become available. I’ve confirmed that Entire can attach each agent’s actual transcript to its fix commit, and I’ll verify that attachment before publishing the trail.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789848067824,"completed_at_ms":1789848069793}}
