ll request #276 from entireio/codex/polish-brain-readme\\\\nPreparing worktree (new branch 'codex/audit-f61-respect-publish-exclusions')\\\\n\\\"}\\n{\\\"finding\\\": 62, \\\"path\\\": \\\"/Users/thomi/.codex/worktrees/audit-fixes-20260919/f62/entire-brain\\\", \\\"branch\\\": \\\"codex/audit-f62-contain-publish-paths\\\", \\\"rc\\\": 0, \\\"output\\\": \\\"HEAD is now at 68c0c258 Merge pull request #276 from entireio/codex/polish-brain-readme\\\\nPreparing worktree (new branch 'codex/audit-f62-contain-publish-paths')\\\\n\\\"}\\n{\\\"finding\\\": 23, \\\"path\\\": \\\"/Users/thomi/.codex/worktrees/audit-fixes-20260919/f23/entire-brain\\\", \\\"branch\\\": \\\"codex/audit-f23-fail-closed-filter-probes\\\", \\\"rc\\\": 0, \\\"output\\\": \\\"HEAD is now at 68c0c258 Merge pull request #276 from entireio/codex/polish-brain-readme\\\\nPreparing worktree (new branch 'codex/audit-f23-fail-closed-filter-probes')\\\\n\\\"}\\n{\\\"finding\\\": 88, \\\"path\\\": \\\"/Users/thomi/.codex/worktrees/audit-fixes-20260919/f88/entire-brain\\\", \\\"branch\\\": \\\"codex/audit-f88-preserve-human-reviews\\\", \\\"rc\\\": 0, \\\"output\\\": \\\"HEAD is now at 68c0c258 Merge pull request #276 from entireio/codex/polish-brain-readme\\\\nPreparing worktree (new branch 'codex/audit-f88-preserve-human-reviews')\\\\n\\\"}\\n\"}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"ae96bc\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.046829833,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1059,\"output\":\"entire trail create — Create a trail for the current, a new, or no branch\\n\\nCurrent repo: gh/entireio/entire-brain  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\\n\\nFlags:\\n      --add-assignee strings   Assign user(s) by login\\n      --base string            Base branch (defaults to detected default branch)\\n      --body string            Trail body\\n      --branch string          Branch for the trail (defaults to current branch)\\n      --checkout               Check out the branch after creating it\\n      --no-branch              Create a branchless trail\\n      --priority string        Priority (urgent, high, medium, low, none)\\n      --status string          Initial status (defaults to open)\\n      --title string           Trail title\\n      --type string            Type (bug, feature, task)\\n\\nInherited flags:\\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\\n      --repo string    Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; defaults to the origin remote\\nentire trail show — Show a trail\\nShow a trail.\\n\\nIf \u003ctrail\u003e is omitted, shows the trail for the current branch (or --branch).\\nOtherwise, \u003ctrail\u003e may be a trail number, id, or branch in the target repo.\\n\\nCurrent repo: gh/entireio/entire-brain  (auto-detected from origin; pass --repo only for a DIFFERENT repo)\\n\\nFlags:\\n      --branch string   Show the trail for this branch instead of the current branch; cannot be combined with a trail selector\\n      --json            Output the trail as JSON (same object shape as one entry of 'trail list --json')\\n\\nInherited flags:\\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\\n      --repo string    Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; defaults to the origin remote\\nShow whether Entire is currently enabled or disabled\\n\\nUsage:\\n  entire status [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n      --detailed   Show detailed status for each settings file\\n  -h, --help       help for status\\n      --json       Output as JSON\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\\nBrief keys: ['generated_at', 'task', 'status', 'semantic', 'history', 'likely_edit_files', 'likely_files',